signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"d3061e5ad7d9c386617d6d9d888c244f6dbbf90d41e3a8b13adee39d48353afc","event_uuid":"141b7c52-2cc2-4676-b7e8-ab673b55101d","position":{"commit_sha":"48518c044466d77bfa76c9e5cd14e62cb46b0d5f","position":"1785532821536411001-141b7c52-2cc2-4676-b7e8-ab673b55101d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"a44b3fbdb98911a54906b838dbed3be8d1b799e1870fd8caad36e20038b57d06","event_uuid":"1392cebf-790f-45b2-8e1b-b7b8ea6dca83","position":{"commit_sha":"48518c044466d77bfa76c9e5cd14e62cb46b0d5f","position":"1785532822268844001-1392cebf-790f-45b2-8e1b-b7b8ea6dca83"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":"claude-code_2-1-220_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"52d5d6e0-1933-4be1-9d52-bba891ba7553","comments":[],"created_at":1785527296356626001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"14d33544-7787-4050-be34-f11c28fa1587","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"a94a-70fa-7991-4f33"},{"link_uuid":"ab718769-8f01-4d79-82a1-49881e2212f8","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"68f5-942c-76a3-4917"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nDiscovered while diagnosing the 2026-07-31 `rebar-autodeploy-errors` alarm. This is the ORIGINATING\nevent for that incident; the reason it became unrecoverable is filed separately as\n304e-9c0f-2068-4d0e (the orphaned lock cannot be reclaimed inside a container).\n\nAt 18:30:48 UTC the review-bot container `1e0fab75d5bd` logged a completed store write\n(`code_review artifact 98a6-8110-6e39-48ce: linked 2/2 trailer refs`) and `Shutting down` in the SAME\nsecond, because an autodeploy cycle recreated it. It created the write-lock dir at 18:30:49 — AFTER\n`Finished server process` — and was SIGKILLed at ~18:30:55 still holding it.\n\n`infra/compose/docker-compose.yml` declares no `stop_grace_period` for the review-bot service, so it\ngets docker's default 10s before SIGKILL. That is not reliably enough for an in-flight store write to\nfinish and release its lock, and the store is append-only with a mkdir lock whose release is the\nprocess's responsibility.\n\nThis is a latent hazard independent of how often deploys run — it simply became likely on a day with\nnine merges driving ~six container recreates in 90 minutes.\n\n## Approach\n\nGive the review-bot a `stop_grace_period` long enough for an in-flight store write to complete and\nrelease its lock, and confirm the service actually handles SIGTERM by finishing that write rather than\nexiting immediately. A grace period only helps if the shutdown path drains the write.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `infra/compose/docker-compose.yml` — review-bot service `stop_grace_period`.\n- The review-bot's SIGTERM/shutdown handling, if it does not currently drain an in-flight store write.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The review-bot service declares a `stop_grace_period` exceeding the worst-case in-flight store\n      write, with the value justified rather than arbitrary.\n- [ ] A SIGTERM during an in-flight store write releases the write-lock before exit; verified by a\n      test or a documented reproduction that stops the container mid-write and shows no lock dir left\n      behind.\n- [ ] The deploy's blast-radius guarantee is unchanged (review-bot only; the gerrit container is not\n      restarted).","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["relates_to","68f5-942c-76a3-4917"],["relates_to","a94a-70fa-7991-4f33"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"141b7c52-2cc2-4676-b7e8-ab673b55101d","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"1a47-61a4-a981-4398","ticket_type":"bug","title":"review-bot has no stop_grace_period, so a deploy recreate can SIGKILL it mid-store-write and orphan the lock","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["84c5c9ca-fee6-48b1-887c-7b42cde06ae9","302bd0ef-4d57-429e-8e58-a17cf5bb2526","02125519-a3b6-47c8-be2c-f3ea4d77ff93","141b7c52-2cc2-4676-b7e8-ab673b55101d","1392cebf-790f-45b2-8e1b-b7b8ea6dca83","14d33544-7787-4050-be34-f11c28fa1587","ab718769-8f01-4d79-82a1-49881e2212f8"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785538666701712078,"uuid":"0a610fc0-185e-478d-a542-d8f2cd25bd43"}